Package: metagoofil
Version: 1.4.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip, git
Section: recon
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/opsdisk/metagoofil
Description: Search Google and download specific file types
 metagoofil is a Python tool that searches Google for specific types of
 files publicly hosted on a website and optionally downloads them to the
 local machine. Useful for OSINT gathering and penetration tests to
 determine what files an organization is leaking to search indexers.
 It defers metadata analysis to tools like exiftool.
